{"data":{"body":"**P2:** Closing registration here is insufficient because an existing continuation can already have passed `isClosing()`, wait while retiring its previous worker, and submit a new step or predicate worker after serialization or invocation End begins. That permits user side effects and checkpoints after success was selected. Make user-worker admission atomic with the manager\u2019s closing state, and test a continuation paused between prior-worker handoff and executor submission.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-HuyR","finding_digest":"57d5fbaee3a6321554e7ac3a5c5925d3939bcc90a6e3bb5df18c716be030a182","finding_id":"arf_v1_k7k7xlxduyzbkvhhvq5fywjf2o","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::completecheckpointcontinuation::post-close-worker-admission","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::completecheckpointcontinuation::post-close-worker-admission","line":172,"observation_digest":"5a784fc93b03f92d2e0b6f2728c8832812224758ebdf1773c5d2ae8aa7610eae","observation_id":"aro_v1_lj4e7sj3ap4s2lqln4tsrsedfa","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_k7k7xlxduyzbkvhhvq5fywjf2o","published_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gja2hfbjnzxta557cdhm3nh4u4","reviewed_base_sha":"1064d0ec32e5b1650b4fa08e65ca960361c7cd1b","reviewed_head_sha":"f256f4f0a303ef8babf5676a2684f94f3686ec33","reviewer":"codex","start_line":172,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_2wp5b3g5f7pghafhvkpygizrzv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
